Output session_kit_s4/s4_verdicts.mp4
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1600
Set Height 750
Hide
Type "export PROMPT='finops-governor %% '"
Enter
Type "clear"
Enter
Show
Type "finops-governor session_kit_s4/plans/s4_demo_plan.json"
Enter
Sleep 5s
Type "finops-governor session_kit_s4/plans/s4_demo_trimmed.json"
Enter
Sleep 5s